AI Supply Chain Control Tower
Day 31 – 60 Days Claude AI Challenge
Overview
AI Supply Chain Control Tower is an interactive browser-based simulation where players take on the role of a Head of Operations responsible for managing a global supply chain. The objective is to respond to operational disruptions, protect business performance, and maximize KPIs before time runs out.
Features
- Live Operations Dashboard
- Real-Time KPI Tracking
- Random Supply Chain Alerts
- Decision-Based Gameplay
- Dynamic Scoring System
- Countdown Timer
- Event Log
- Performance Grade (A+ to D)
- Pause Function
- Help & Instructions Modal
- Sound Toggle (Visual)
- Responsive Design
- Fully Offline Single HTML File

Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

Gameplay

Players receive continuous operational alerts such as supplier delays, port congestion, warehouse shortages, truck breakdowns, and weather disruptions. Every decision affects business KPIs including service level, customer satisfaction, inventory health, transportation efficiency, operating cost, revenue protected, and overall score.

As the game progresses, alert frequency increases, creating a more challenging operational environment.

